OL,3,GNEWSAMan abducted, assaulted and thrown
OL,4,Afrom moving car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been left with "lasting
OL,7,Fphysical and psychological trauma"
OL,8,Fafter being abducted, assaulted by
OL,9,Fmultiple people armed with iron bars
OL,10,Fand then thrown from a moving car,
OL,11,Fpolice have said.
OL,13,FThe man, aged in his 30s, was found
OL,14,Flying on the Culvacullion Road in
OL,15,FGortin, County Tyrone, at about 21:30
OL,16,Fon Sunday.
OL,18,FPolice described it as a "brutal
OL,19,Fattack" and said the man had sustained
OL,20,Fa number of limb fractures, rib
OL,21,Ffractures and a head injury.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
