OL,3,GNEWSAMan abducted, assaulted and thrown
OL,4,Afrom moving car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vehicle was located on fire on nearby
OL,7,FRylagh Road a short time later and
OL,8,Fpolice said one line of enquiry is that
OL,9,Fthis vehicle may have been used by
OL,10,Fthose who carried out this assault.
